Action: Shift delete from list
input: index (index) at which to remove value from data array
            (array) using shift deleting
output: value deleted

set removed to array[index]

for each position (i) in array starting at index up to size - 1:
    set array[i] to array[i+1]

set array[size-1] to blank (0)
Decrease size by one

Action:     Shift insert into list
input:      value (value) to be added to list
            index (index) at which to insert value into data array
output:     None

If index is not within bounds of data:
    Throw exception to indicate index is outside data bounds

Ensure capacity for new element

for each position (i) in array starting at size and ending at index:
    set array[i] to array[i-1]

set array[index] to value
Increase size by one